            "review_title": "Review at Cork & Bottle Wine Bar",
            "review_text": "Hanoi Rofi\nHanoi, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nGreat Wines...but such ruined experience!\nJun 2025 • Friends\nThe location is very nice, with an amazing lake-view, and the wine list is quite nice and at good prices.\n\nSadly, our experience has been ruined by one staff...........\n\nThey have a good waiter ( a boy) and a gentle young girl. \nBut sadly... there is also a very rude older girl. She continuously screams, talks very loudly, and even badly sings!!\nShe behaves quite rudely, and she made our evening ... horrible!\n\nThe place deserves 4 or even 5 stars, but we must give ONE star just cause her.\nA suggestion: please, send her away, she has no service skills at all\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 30, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
