            "review_text": "Leannie\nHong Kong, China3214 contributions\n1\nSuch a welcoming bar\nNov 2022\nCame here as a group last night for the first time and we all enjoyed ourselves so much! Weds they have a happy hour(s) menu which is longer for the ladies, this was a great opportunity to sample a few of the wines in one evening. There was the option of food which a few of the group had and enjoyed (breads with camembert etc.)\nThe guys that worked here was so lovely and attentive, the second you finished your glass of wine they were there for a top up!\nHighly recommend for the wines and service\nRead more\nValue\nService\nWritten December 1, 2022",
